yunmai-noble-full
=================

Metapackage. Install it to get the complete application:

  yunmai-noble           service, web dashboard, bundled Bun runtime
  yunmai-noble-desktop   GPUI dashboard and simulator control app

The desktop client is in Applications as "Yunmai Noble" and connects to
http://127.0.0.1:3000.

The virtual scale for demos is a separate package:

  sudo apt install yunmai-noble-simulator

That installs a second service on 127.0.0.1:3100 with its own database,
so a simulated scale can run alongside a real one. It is not a
dependency of this metapackage because it starts an extra service.
